Z||000008||SCCA FIERO||04-30-2000||03:31 AM||||Well I tried to get the swaybar in there and I can't see it going. If it has been done can you explain what to do?<P>Also the bar is angled at the ends and I am wondering if they angle up or down. <P>I put the brackets on the struts and I hope I did that right. The brackets are labled with an "R" and an "L". I put them on the front part of the struts, the part that has the nuts on them, so all I had to do is remove the nuts and put the bracket on... I did that right. Right?||||reg||1
